OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,FFormer Manchester United captain Gary
OL,8,FNeville has launched a scathing tirade
OL,9,Fat some of the club's current squad -
OL,10,Ftelling them "they're nothing".
OL,12,FIt comes as the future of head coach
OL,13,FMichael Carrick hangs precariously in
OL,14,Fthe balance, following another heavy
OL,15,Fdefeat, extending their winless run in
OL,16,Fall competitions to eight games.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
