OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793022500
OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,FDuring United's 3-0 defeat to
OL,8,FBournemouth at Old Trafford on Sunday
OL,9,FOctober 25, it was the players, not
OL,10,Fthe manager, who were the subject of
OL,11,Fmuch of the fan's ire as they shouted
OL,12,Ffrom the stands.
OL,14,FIt seems Neville also agrees with
OL,15,Fthem, as he criticised the attitude of
OL,16,Fsome members of the team on his Gary
OL,17,FNeville podcast, saying he has "no
OL,18,Ftime for them".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793022500
OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,FHe said: "There's a few of them that
OL,8,Faren't that professional. There's a
OL,9,Fcouple of them... I live in
OL,10,FManchester, they're not that
OL,11,Fprofessional, some of them.
OL,13,F"I've got no time for them. There's a
OL,14,Ffew of them that don't go to bed at
OL,15,Fthe right time. Don't eat the right
OL,16,Fthings. Don't think about Manchester
OL,17,FUnited every single minute of every
OL,18,Fsingle day.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793022500
OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,F"They are not living and breathing
OL,8,Fthis football club, as they should be,
OL,9,Flike professionals should.
OL,11,F"And why? Why? Because it's gone to
OL,12,Ftheir heads. But they still walk
OL,13,Faround like they're King William...
OL,14,Fthey're not, they're nothing."
OL,16,FMeanwhile, he strongly defended their
OL,17,Funder-fire boss Michael Carrick,
OL,18,Fdescribing him as a "brilliant man"
OL,19,Fwith "integrity, credibility, decency,
OL,20,Fprofessionalism".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793022500
OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,FIn his post-match press conference
OL,8,Ffollowing the Bournemouth defeat,
OL,9,FCarrick sidestepped some fairly blunt
OL,10,Fquestions from reporters, who asked
OL,11,Fhim if he expected to be sacked.
OL,13,F"I'm not expecting anything in
OL,14,Fparticular, to be honest. I'm carrying
OL,15,Fon as normal," he said.
OL,17,F"I love this place. I'll always do
OL,18,Fwhat I feel is going to be the best
OL,19,Ffor the football club, whatever
OL,20,Fdecision is made on anything really,
OL,21,Fso that's kind of it."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
