OL,3,CGary Neville criticises Manchester
OL,4,CUnited players as manager's future at
OL,5,Cstake
OL,7,FIn recent days, a number of potential
OL,8,Fcandidates to replace Carrick have
OL,9,Fpublicly denied that they have had
OL,10,Fdiscussions with the Manchester United
OL,11,Fhierarchy, including former Chelsea
OL,12,Fand Tottenham boss Antonio Conte, and
OL,13,FBrighton head coach Fabian Hurzeler.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
